# Developer 2 — AI + sidecars

## Owns

Adapters for DeepSeek Harness, AstrBot, Nango, MCP gateway/registry, TencentDB memory, LLM, ContextBuilder, AgentService, MessagingService, AuthConnector implementations, Compose sidecar wiring, fake/mock modes.

## Forbidden

- Inventing parallel Goal/Source/catalog schemas
- Product Goals/Use agent loops inside AstrBot
- Changing Dev1 CRUD routers except to call `ActivityService.record()`

## Isolation

- Harness only via `AgentService`
- AstrBot only via `MessagingService`
- Nango only via `AuthConnector`
- Never put OAuth tokens in agent prompts or frontend payloads
